{
  "about": "Global options typed after the subcommand, the same in both CLIs (the sandbox-default lane, 2026-09-27): `--profile <name>` (also `--profile=<name>`), `--max-tool-rounds <n>` (also `--max-tool-rounds=<n>`, 2026-09-28) and `--no-sandbox` are lifted to the front of the arguments before parsing, in the order found, wherever they appear; nothing past `--` moves. `--no-sandbox` is a root option in both CLIs that puts WEBAGENTS_NO_SANDBOX=1 in the environment, as `--profile` puts WEBAGENTS_PROFILE; the shell reads it (sandbox/srt.json `status`). Python: webagents/cli/sandbox_default_argv.py, tests/cli/test_sandbox_default_global_options.py. TypeScript: src/cli/sandbox-default-argv.ts, tests/unit/cli/sandbox-default-global-options.test.ts.",
